'''Nog''' was the owner of {{mu|Quark's|Quark's Bar}} on {{mu|Terok Nor}} in [[2372]]. He had a great distrust of tall men, but an equal interest in tall women.

Nog inherited the bar after the [[death]] of his uncle {{mu|Quark}} and his father {{mu|Rom}}, both at the order of [[Intendant]] {{mu|Kira Nerys}}. In gratitude, Nog helped the Intendant escape from the custody of the [[Terran Resistance Forces]]. However, the Intendant killed Nog on the off chance that he might tell the rebels that she had escaped. ({{DS9|Shattered Mirror}})

{{bginfo|Like his [[Nog|prime counterpart]], Nog was portrayed by [[Aron Eisenberg]].|Eisenberg commented: "''Nog had to be obnoxious and rude, so I played him like an edgy [[Quark]]''". Eisenberg performed his own stunts in the episode, drawing on his martial arts training. ({{ds9c|330}})}}

